{"id":"n24803-1-9","stage":2,"title":"작성 · 制订","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24803-1-9-1","ko":"보고서 작성은 다 끝났나요?","zh":"报告已经写完了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"보고서","meaning":"报告书","explanation":"보고서：报告书","readings":[{"term":"보고서","audio":"/audio/01a64adf7f1500650cfd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59656","senseId":"1","lemma":"보고서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"작성은","meaning":"制订，写，起草","explanation":"작성：制订，写，起草；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"작성","audio":"/audio/4f961469c457130737f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24803","senseId":"1","lemma":"작성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"快，就要","explanation":"다：快，就要","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"2","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끝났나요?","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"끝나다：结束，完成；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"01a64adf7f150065","term":"보고서","zh":"报告书","audio":"/audio/01a64adf7f1500650cfd.mp3","entryId":"59656","definition":"告知研究、调查内容或结果的文件或文章。","pronunciation":["보ː고서"]},{"id":"4f961469c4571307","term":"작성","zh":"制订，写，起草","audio":"/audio/4f961469c457130737f2.mp3","entryId":"24803","definition":"拟定稿件或文件等。","pronunciation":["작썽"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"快，就要","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"动作或状态的程度似乎接近限定程度地。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"事情做完。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/34b4a7cdb9e094430f02.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24803-1-9-2","ko":"아니요. 아직 열 장 정도 더 써야 해요.","zh":"还没有，还得再写大概十页左右。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","pa